{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation","title":"代码导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/navigation","wordCount":936,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码导航\">代码导航</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码导航回答的是「<strong>这个符号从哪来、用到哪去、是什么类型</strong>」这一类问题。所有导航功能都遵循同一个模式：客户端提供「光标位置」，服务端返回「一组位置」。区别只在于查找的方向和范围。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>导航方式</th>\n<th>查找方向</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跳转定义</td>\n<td>引用 → 定义</td>\n<td>跨文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用查找</td>\n<td>定义 → 所有引用</td>\n<td>跨文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档符号</td>\n<td>文件 → 结构大纲</td>\n<td>单文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用/类型层级</td>\n<td>沿调用链/继承链双向展开</td>\n<td>跨文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个贯穿所有导航的取舍是：返回 <code>Location</code>（简单）还是 <code>LocationLink</code>（精确高亮），以及是否用「准备 + 逐级展开」的懒加载来避免一次性计算整个层级树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跳转定义\">跳转定义</h2><p>跳转定义（Go to Definition）是开发者最常用的导航功能。LSP 通过 <code>textDocument/definition</code> 请求实现，返回符号的定义位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DefinitionParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentIdentifier;&#10;  position: Position;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type DefinitionResult = Location | Location[] | LocationLink[] | null;&#10;&#10;interface Location {&#10;  uri: string;&#10;  range: Range;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LocationLink {&#10;  originSelectionRange?: Range;&#10;  targetUri: string;&#10;  targetRange: Range;&#10;  targetSelectionRange: Range;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DefinitionParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DefinitionResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocationLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  uri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocationLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originSelectionRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetUri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetSelectionRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: Ctrl+Click 或 F12&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/definition&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 解析符号,查找定义&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: Location / LocationLink&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 跳转到定义位置\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: Ctrl+Click 或 F12\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/definition\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 解析符号,查找定义\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: Location / LocationLink\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 跳转到定义位置</pre><p>Location 与 LocationLink 的区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>LocationLink</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标位置</td>\n<td>uri + range</td>\n<td>targetUri + targetRange</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确选择范围</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>targetSelectionRange</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>源头高亮范围</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>originSelectionRange</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Peek 预览支持</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>完整（带精确高亮）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端能力要求</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>definition.linkSupport = true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 优先返回 <code>LocationLink</code>，因为它提供了 <code>targetSelectionRange</code> 用于精确高亮定义的标识符，而非整个声明块。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型定义与实现\">类型定义与实现</h2><p>除了基础的跳转定义，LSP 还提供类型定义和实现跳转，在面向对象和接口驱动的代码中尤为有用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"connection.onTypeDefinition((params): Location[] | null =&gt; {&#10;  const symbol = findSymbolAt(params.textDocument.uri, params.position);&#10;  if (!symbol) return null;&#10;  const typeDecl = resolveTypeDeclaration(symbol);&#10;  return typeDecl ? [typeDecl.location] : null;&#10;});&#10;&#10;connection.onImplementation((params): Location[] | null =&gt; {&#10;  const symbol = findSymbolAt(params.textDocument.uri, params.position);&#10;  if (!symbol || symbol.kind !== &#39;interface&#39;) return null;&#10;  return findImplementations(symbol);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onTypeDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findSymbolAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.textDocument.uri, params.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">symbol) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> typeDecl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveTypeDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#2