<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCallers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCallHierarchyOutgoingCalls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CallHierarchyOutgoingCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCallees</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 入站调用 Incoming&#10;        A[&quot;handleRequest()&quot;] --&gt; TARGET[&quot;processData()&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;batchProcess()&quot;] --&gt; TARGET&#10;        C[&quot;testHelper()&quot;] --&gt; TARGET&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 出站调用 Outgoing&#10;        TARGET --&gt; D[&quot;validateInput()&quot;]&#10;        TARGET --&gt; E[&quot;transformData()&quot;]&#10;        TARGET --&gt; F[&quot;saveResult()&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 入站调用 Incoming\n        A[\"handleRequest()\"] --&gt; TARGET[\"processData()\"]\n        B[\"batchProcess()\"] --&gt; TARGET\n        C[\"testHelper()\"] --&gt; TARGET\n    end\n    subgraph 出站调用 Outgoing\n        TARGET --&gt; D[\"validateInput()\"]\n        TARGET --&gt; E[\"transformData()\"]\n        TARGET --&gt; F[\"saveResult()\"]\n    end</pre><p>调用层级的三步协议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>请求</th>\n<th>返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准备</td>\n<td>textDocument/prepareCallHierarchy</td>\n<td>CallHierarchyItem（锚点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入站调用</td>\n<td>callHierarchy/incomingCalls</td>\n<td>调用此函数的所有位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出站调用</td>\n<td>callHierarchy/outgoingCalls</td>\n<td>此函数调用的所有函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>类型层级的协议结构类似：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>请求</th>\n<th>返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准备</td>\n<td>textDocument/prepareTypeHierarchy</td>\n<td>TypeHierarchyItem（锚点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超类型</td>\n<td>typeHierarchy/supertypes</td>\n<td>父类/实现的接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子类型</td>\n<td>typeHierarchy/subtypes</td>\n<td>子类/接口实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 调用层级和类型层级都采用&quot;准备 + 逐级展开&quot;的懒加载模式，避免一次性计算整个层级树。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代码导航))&#10;    跳转定义&#10;      definition / typeDefinition&#10;      implementation / declaration&#10;      LocationLink 精确高亮&#10;    引用查找&#10;      全项目扫描&#10;      includeDeclaration 控制&#10;      索引加速&#10;    文档符号&#10;      层级 DocumentSymbol&#10;      扁平 SymbolInformation&#10;      大纲视图&#10;    调用层级&#10;      入站调用 incomingCalls&#10;      出站调用 outgoingCalls&#10;      三步懒加载协议&#10;    类型层级&#10;      超类型 supertypes&#10;      子类型 subtypes&#10;      接口继承链\">mindmap\n  root((代码导航))\n    跳转定义\n      definition / typeDefinition\n      implementation / declaration\n      LocationLink 精确高亮\n    引用查找\n      全项目扫描\n      includeDeclaration 控制\n      索引加速\n    文档符号\n      层级 DocumentSymbol\n      扁平 SymbolInformation\n      大纲视图\n    调用层级\n      入站调用 incomingCalls\n      出站调用 outgoingCalls\n      三步懒加载协议\n    类型层级\n      超类型 supertypes\n      子类型 subtypes\n      接口继承链</pre><ul>\n<li>LSP 提供 <strong>definition/typeDefinition/implementation/declaration</strong> 四种跳转导航。</li>\n<li><strong>LocationLink</strong> 比 Location 提供更精确的选择范围，支持更好的 Peek 预览体验。</li>\n<li><strong>引用查找</strong>需要全项目扫描，通过 <code>includeDeclaration</code> 参数控制是否包含定义位置。</li>\n<li><strong>文档符号</strong>提供文件级的结构化大纲，支持层级（DocumentSymbol）和扁平（SymbolInformation）两种格式。</li>\n<li><strong>调用层级和类型层级</strong>采用&quot;准备 + 逐级展开&quot;的懒加载协议，避免一次性计算全部层级关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码导航","id":"代码导航"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跳转定义","id":"跳转定义"},{"level":2,"text":"类型定义与实现","id":"类型定义与实现"},{"level":2,"text":"引用查找","id":"引用查找"},{"level":2,"text":"文档符号","id":"文档符号"},{"level":2,"text":"调用层级与类型层级","id":"调用层级与类型层级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/diagnostics"},"next":{"title":"重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/refactoring"}}